Seed: the query interceptor no longer rewrites an IComparer's Compare over ranges, so EF Core reads RangeLowerBoundComparer.Compare as the range order in SQL (#385)
Oracles: TranslationSupportProbeTests
Fails: RangeLowerBoundComparer<TRange, T>.Compare on every range type: classified client, but runs as SQL now, and Select answers 1 or -1 where memory answers 0 for an equal lower bound
History: shipped through 10.2.0, fixed in 10.3.0 (#396) and 11.0.0

